                            <comment id="16119475" author="githubbot" created="Wed, 9 Aug 2017 06:31:06 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;GitHub user sarutak opened a pull request:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/2418&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/2418&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-6002&quot; title=&quot;Make log message more pretty when instance name is null&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-6002&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-6002&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; Make log message more pretty when instance name is null&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    When instance name is null, log message containing &quot;null&quot; is shown like as follows.&lt;/p&gt;

