    &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;09-08-2017 14:49:38&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;INFO &amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#15%null%&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;grid-timeout-worker-#15%null%&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;IgniteKernal&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
    Metrics for local node (to disable set &apos;metricsLogFrequency&apos; to 0)&lt;br/&gt;
        ^-- Node &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;id=de0743ec, name=null, uptime=00:01:00:007&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
    ```&lt;/p&gt;

