                            <comment id="16163463" author="sarutak" created="Tue, 12 Sep 2017 18:43:23 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=avinogradov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;avinogradov&quot;&gt;avinogradov&lt;/a&gt; If you have time, could you review this?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16164355" author="avinogradov" created="Wed, 13 Sep 2017 09:06:56 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=sarutak&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;sarutak&quot;&gt;sarutak&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;br/&gt;
It looks like you changed &lt;tt&gt;name=null&lt;/tt&gt; with empty space.&lt;br/&gt;
Could you please explain reason to hide param in case it&apos;s value is null?&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Also, next time, please, assign issue to yourself before asking review.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16164521" author="sarutak" created="Wed, 13 Sep 2017 11:36:27 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=avinogradov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;avinogradov&quot;&gt;avinogradov&lt;/a&gt; Thanks for your reply!&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It looks like you changed name=null with empty space.&lt;br/&gt;
Could you please explain reason to hide param in case it&apos;s value is null?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I think, it&apos;s not useful information and little bit ugly.&lt;br/&gt;
There are already lots of code like this change in IgniteKernel.java. Following example is one of them.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;log = (GridLoggerProxy)cfg.getGridLogger().getLogger(
    getClass().getName() + (igniteInstanceName != &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;null&lt;/span&gt; ? &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&apos;%&apos;&lt;/span&gt; + igniteInstanceName : &quot;&quot;));
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Also, next time, please, assign issue to yourself before asking review.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I&apos;d like to do that but I didn&apos;t edit Assignee field.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16164604" author="avinogradov" created="Wed, 13 Sep 2017 12:57:12 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Thanks for explanation. &lt;br/&gt;
Patch accepted and merged to master.&lt;br/&gt;
Thanks for contribution.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
